{"type":"text","timestamp":"2026-09-27T11:45:03.972Z","data":{"text":"Task complete.\n\nSummary of changes:\n\n- **`src/core/status/dispatch-order.ts`** — `orderDispatchItems` now accepts an optional fourth `firstSeen` map (`FirstSeenTimes`, default empty). Weight ties break by first-seen time (logged before unlogged, earlier first) before change id/task. `reasonFor` emits `waiting since <YYYY-MM-DD HH:MM>` (local) when no idle/holds-up reason applies and a first-seen exists.\n- **`src/core/status/dispatch.ts`** — `readDispatch` and `readDispatchQueue` take optional `home` (default `os.homedir()`) and pass the wait log's `firstSeenTimes` (empty map when no log).\n- **`src/core/status/dispatch-watch.ts`** — `WatchDispatchOptions` gains `home`; `OnItems` gains the `idle` third argument; each derivation reads the wait log under `home`, orders with first-seen times, and calls `onItems(items, at, watcherIdle)`.\n- **`tests/dispatch-age.test.ts`** — new coverage for \"First seen breaks ties\", \"Logged before unlogged\", and \"Idle and first seen\".\n\nVerification:\n- `node --import tsx --test tests/dispatch-age.test.ts` — 3/3 pass.\n- Existing `dispatch-order`, `dispatch-watch`, `inbox-dispatch`, `inbox-follow`, `dispatch-session` tests pass unchanged.\n- `pnpm verify` (CLI/UI typechecks, build, full suite, lint) passes.\n\nResult written to `openspec/changes/101-inbox-wait-log/.run/results/2.md`."}}
